rooms_desc ({"	You have entered a large square room with plush carpeting.   There are windows on two sides of the room and the ceiling has a skylight.   Throughthe skylight you see the full moon shining down to the vast expanses of the floor.  A calm comes over you as you realize you are safe in the presence ofLung.  All is well.","	A large room sits here with all of Lung's creature comforts.  A largecolor television rests on a shelf in one of the upper corners of the room.  Asmall refrigerator lies on the floor next to the couch.  You believe it is most likely full of beer.   There is a lot of commotion to the south, you thinkit must be the gaming room that he has been bragging about.  Back to the westlies the conference room and the exit to the church. ","	You have entered the gaming room of Monk Lung and you must want to playone of the games.  Your choices include darts, pool, phooseball, and beerpong.  You have never felt more at home than you do here.  You realize thisbecause Lung is an extravagant host.  To the north returns you to the sittingroom.  Explore the other exits to find out what else this home has to offeryou!!!!!","	You've seen the stories on \"A Current Affair\", you have read the screaming headlines in the Sun and National Enquirer, but only now do youunderstand the extent of a college students need for WOMEN!!!!!	The room is extremely strange for virgin eyes such as yours. Other thanthe bed, dresser, and mirror all the other gadgets and objects seem strange.You wonder what there use is, and giggle with your own imagination as new andexotic ideas spring to mind.  You really think you should be ashamed but youaren't!!!!!!",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"	The meeting room of Monk Lung.","Lung's living room","Monk Lung's gaming room!","Lung's bedroom",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
